{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is approached, take it and process it. If not, move to visible objects or scan the area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    />\"",
